{
    "title": "Chat Cloner Web QR Scanner",
    "description": "<h3><b>1. Features</b></h3>\r\n     \u2714Sync Chat messages by scanning Chat QR Code\r\n     \u2714 Read & Access Others Chat\r\n     \u2714 Link & Clone 5 different Chat Accounts\r\n     \u2714 Link Your Own Chat Account\r\n     \u2714 Link Device that is far away from you\r\n     \u2714Hide \"Logged In\" Notification from Linked device\r\n     \u2714 Become Offline to others while being online\r\n     \u2714 Download and Upload Files on Linked Accounts\r\n     \u2714Get \"New Message\" Notification\r\n     \u2714Block Keyboard Switch\r\n     \u2714Share Chat QR Code\r\n\r\n<h3><b>2. QR Code Scanner</b></h3>\r\n     \u2714Scan QR with Auto Flashlight\r\n     \u2714Create QR Code with QR Code Generator\r\n     \u2714 Scan QR Code from Gallery\r\n     \u2714Save QR Code History\r\n\r\n<h3><b>3. Status Saver</b></h3>\r\n     \u2714 Download Photos & Videos from Status and Updates\r\n     \u2714Play and Share Photos & Videos\r\n\r\n<h3><b>4. Chat with a Stranger</b></h3>\r\n     \u2714 Send Message to any Unknown Number\r\n     \u2714 Direct Chat without Saving Number\r\n\r\nThis App lets you Clone and Read different Chat Accounts on your Phone. You can add Up to 5 different Chat accounts on your phone. You have the option to read chat without sender knowing. Protect your family by keeping eye on their Chat with Chat Cloner App. \r\n\r\nWith the dual chat cloner app you can login and use multi chat accounts which means you can use parallel chat accounts on one phone at the same time. The dual chat feature allows you to use multiple accounts to send and receive messages and chat with your friends and family.\r\n\r\nElevate your chat experience with dual chat and many other features. The QR  code scanner & generator allows you to scan and create QR code providing you with the best experience for QR scanning. Never miss out any status update of your contacts,  you can download and save any status and share it with others. With the Direct Chat feature, say goodbye to the hassle of saving contact numbers, you can send messages and chat with anyone without saving their number to the contacts. \r\n\r\nThis app is similar to parallel space, dual space, multiple accounts, parallel accounts, 2 accounts.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udd38Disclaimer</b>\r\n\u2022 It is an independent application and is not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with the official WhatsApp application or WhatsApp Inc.\r\n\u2022 It is a standalone application and its features and services are distinct from those offered by WhatsApp.\r\n\u2022 We strictly abides by the data privacy protection policy and will never collect your personal information for any purpose.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h3><b>1. Features</b></h3><br>     \u2714Sync Chat messages by scanning Chat QR Code<br>     \u2714 Read &amp; Access Others Chat<br>     \u2714 Link &amp; Clone 5 different Chat Accounts<br>     \u2714 Link Your Own Chat Account<br>     \u2714 Link Device that is far away from you<br>     \u2714Hide &quot;Logged In&quot; Notification from Linked device<br>     \u2714 Become Offline to others while being online<br>     \u2714 Download and Upload Files on Linked Accounts<br>     \u2714Get &quot;New Message&quot; Notification<br>     \u2714Block Keyboard Switch<br>     \u2714Share Chat QR Code<br><br><h3><b>2. QR Code Scanner</b></h3><br>     \u2714Scan QR with Auto Flashlight<br>     \u2714Create QR Code with QR Code Generator<br>     \u2714 Scan QR Code from Gallery<br>     \u2714Save QR Code History<br><br><h3><b>3. Status Saver</b></h3><br>     \u2714 Download Photos &amp; Videos from Status and Updates<br>     \u2714Play and Share Photos &amp; Videos<br><br><h3><b>4. Chat with a Stranger</b></h3><br>     \u2714 Send Message to any Unknown Number<br>     \u2714 Direct Chat without Saving Number<br><br>This App lets you Clone and Read different Chat Accounts on your Phone. You can add Up to 5 different Chat accounts on your phone. You have the option to read chat without sender knowing. Protect your family by keeping eye on their Chat with Chat Cloner App. <br><br>With the dual chat cloner app you can login and use multi chat accounts which means you can use parallel chat accounts on one phone at the same time. The dual chat feature allows you to use multiple accounts to send and receive messages and chat with your friends and family.<br><br>Elevate your chat experience with dual chat and many other features. The QR  code scanner &amp; generator allows you to scan and create QR code providing you with the best experience for QR scanning. Never miss out any status update of your contacts,  you can download and save any status and share it with others. With the Direct Chat feature, say goodbye to the hassle of saving contact numbers, you can send messages and chat with anyone without saving their number to the contacts. <br><br>This app is similar to parallel space, dual space, multiple accounts, parallel accounts, 2 accounts.<br><br><b>\ud83d\udd38Disclaimer</b><br>\u2022 It is an independent application and is not affiliated, associated, authorized, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with the official WhatsApp application or WhatsApp Inc.<br>\u2022 It is a standalone application and its features and services are distinct from those offered by WhatsApp.<br>\u2022 We strictly abides by the data privacy protection policy and will never collect your personal information for any purpose.",
